sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Request Producer
    participant Broker as Message Broker<br/>(Redis :6379 / GCP Pub/Sub :443)
    participant Processor as async-processor<br/>Worker Pool
    participant Gate as Prometheus Gate<br/>:9090
    participant Backend as Inference Gateway<br/>(vLLM :8000)
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC
    participant Health as Health Server<br/>:8081
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>:9090
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet

    Note over Producer,Broker: 1. Request Ingestion
    Producer->>Broker: Publish inference request<br/>(topic/queue)
    Broker->>Processor: Consume message<br/>(random-robin merge to pool channels)

    Note over Processor,Backend: 2. Inference Dispatch
    Processor->>Gate: Check admission gate<br/>(Prometheus metric query)
    Gate-->>Processor: Admission decision<br/>(allow/throttle)

    alt Admission Allowed
        Processor->>Backend: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS 1.2+ / mTLS)
        Processor->>OTel: Export trace span<br/>(OTLP/gRPC)
        Backend-->>Processor: Inference result<br/>(JSON response)
    end

    Note over Processor,Broker: 3. Result Return
    alt Success
        Processor->>Broker: Publish result<br/>(result channel)
    else Failure
        Processor->>Broker: Publish to retry channel<br/>(for reprocessing)
    end

    Note over Health,Kubelet: 4. Health & Metrics Surface
    Kubelet->>Health: GET /healthz<br/>(liveness probe, unauthenticated)
    Health-->>Kubelet: 200 OK

    Kubelet->>Health: GET /readyz<br/>(readiness probe, gate-aware)
    Health-->>Kubelet: 200 OK / 503

    Note over Metrics: Metrics: :9090/metrics<br/>K8s-delegated auth
